<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάνᾰβος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάννᾰβος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wooden framework</i> round which artists
			moulded wax or clay, <i>block-figure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.164
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.189
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mannikin</i> or <i>rough drawing of the human frame</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				515a35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				743a2
			</span></i> (wrongly expld. as <i>cistern</i> by <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in GA</u>
				109.27
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>lean person, 'skeleton</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Spelling and quantity undetermined: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίναβος</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
